            "column_size": "2",
            "title": "AI Camera Measurement",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "subheading": "",
            "content": "<p>Ceiling-mounted cameras with edge AI processing. Accurate people counting (98.5%), zone tracking, dwell time, heatmaps, and passerby measurement. Privacy-first—no facial recognition, no video storage.</p><ul><li><strong>People Counting</strong></li><li><strong>Zone Analytics</strong></li><li><strong>Dwell Time</strong></li><li><strong>Heatmaps</strong></li></ul>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "item_jAdBnT": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "picto-document",
            "icon_width": 32,
            "icon_background_type": "square",
            "icon_background": "#a0b842",
            "icon_color": "#f9fafb",
            "background_color": "#f2f2f2",
            "text_color": "",
            "border_color": "#f2f2f2",
            "show_controls": false,
            "column_size": "2",
            "title": "Retail Analytics Platform",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "subheading": "",
            "content": "<p>Web-based dashboard and mobile app for store managers, analysts, and executives. Real-time KPIs, conversion tracking, traffic trends, staff-to-customer ratios, and role-based views across single or multi-store deployments.</p><ul><li>Conversion Tracking</li><li>Traffic Trends</li><li>Multi-Store</li></ul>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "item_wA6Lwn": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "picto-file",
            "icon_width": 32,
            "icon_background_type": "square",
            "icon_background": "#a0b842",
            "icon_color": "#f9fafb",
            "background_color": "#f2f2f2",
            "text_color": "",
            "border_color": "#f2f2f2",
            "show_controls": false,
            "column_size": "2",
            "title": "FIDA / Integrations",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "subheading": "",
            "content": "<p>Flow Integration & Data Aggregation (FIDA) connects POS systems, staff scheduling, and external data sources. API-first architecture supports custom integrations and data export for enterprise BI tools.</p><ul><li>POS Integration</li><li>Scheduling Sync</li><li>API Access</li></ul>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "item_ifUhXk": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "picto-customer-support",
            "icon_width": 32,
            "icon_background_type": "square",
            "icon_background": "#a0b842",
            "icon_color": "#f9fafb",
            "background_color": "#f2f2f2",
            "text_color": "",
            "border_color": "#f2f2f2",
            "show_controls": false,
            "column_size": "2",
            "title": "Flow AI / Decision Support",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "subheading": "",
            "content": "<p>Staffing recommendations, anomaly detection, performance alerts, and trend forecasting. AI layer helps store teams understand what's happening and what to do about it—built on accurate measurement, not speculation.</p><ul><li>Staffing Alerts</li><li>Anomaly Detection</li><li>Forecasting</li></ul>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
